      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "Also: connection IDs survive IP changes, and TLS 1.3 is built in.",
      "narration": "Retransmissions use new packet numbers, which removes ambiguity. Connection IDs let a connection survive IP changes, and TLS 1.3 is part of the handshake.",
